  "id": "tank28-native-repeat-20261026-r001",
  "description": "Repeat the accepted full-mesh H128/S15 raw-frame1 forward with unchanged inputs, weights and strict oracle. Compile C64 streamed and C64 colored once each; collect three fresh sessions per condition in A,B,B,A,A,B order. Each runtime has one resident step, all outputs, immutable inputs and same-PE clocks. Establish repeatability before comparing local-interval distributions; no GPU speedup or long-rollout accuracy claim.",
